"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p028","text":"項羽出關，使人徙義帝。曰：「古之帝者地方千里，必居上游。」乃使使徙義帝長沙郴縣，趣義帝行，群臣稍倍叛之，乃陰令衡山王、臨江王擊之，殺義帝江南。項羽怨田榮，立齊將田都為齊王。田榮怒，因自立為齊王，殺田都而反楚；予彭越將軍印，令反梁地。楚令蕭公角擊彭越，彭越大破之。陳餘怨項羽之弗王己也，令夏說說田榮，請兵擊張耳。齊予陳餘兵，擊破常山王張耳，張耳亡歸漢。迎趙王歇於代，復立為趙王。趙王因立陳餘為代王。項羽大怒，北擊齊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"義帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"義帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"義帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"衡山王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"臨江王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"義帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000682","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"田都","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000704","status":"cont