169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000676","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0176","start":176,"end":179,"surface":"趙王歇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000674","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0192","start":192,"end":194,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000675","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m028-0198","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p020","text":"張耳之國，陳餘愈益怒，曰：「張耳與餘功等也，今張耳王，餘獨侯，此項羽不平。」及齊王田榮畔楚，陳餘乃使夏説説田榮曰：「項羽爲天下宰不平，盡王諸將善地，徙故王王惡地，今趙王乃居代！願王假臣兵，請以南皮爲捍蔽。」田榮欲樹黨於趙以反楚，乃遣兵從陳餘。陳餘因悉三縣兵襲常山王張耳。張耳敗走，念諸侯無可歸者，曰：「漢王與我有舊故，而項羽又彊，立我，我欲之楚。」甘公曰：「漢王之入關，五星聚東井。東井者，秦分也。先至必霸。楚雖彊，後必屬漢。」故耳走漢。漢王亦還定三秦，方圍章邯廢丘。張耳謁漢王，漢王厚遇之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005019","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0039","start":39,"end":43,"surface":"齊王田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004998","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0046","s