","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0219","start":219,"end":221,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004988","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0229","start":229,"end":231,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005016","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0234","start":234,"end":236,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0237","start":237,"end":239,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004988","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m020-0240","start":240,"end":242,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004988","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger","book_id":"b-shiji-089","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-089-zhanger"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:p021","text":"陳餘已敗張耳，皆復收趙地，迎趙王於代，復爲趙王。趙王德陳餘，立以爲代王。陳餘爲趙王弱，國初定，不之國，留傅趙王，而使夏説以相國守代。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m021-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m021-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"張耳","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004983","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m021-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005004","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m021-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005004","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m021-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005004","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-089-zhanger:m021-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"陳餘","kind":"person","person_id